      "content": "it just feels so heavy... like i'm carrying this mass of unnecessary energy every day. if letting go is the logical response to reality, then why is there so much pressure to keep pretending that the struggle matters? it feels like the only way to actually align with the truth of the universe is to just... stop. to stop the expenditure of energy entirely.",
